{
  "note": "The 9:16 share image both apps draw (src/lib/share/shareCard.ts SHARE_CARD; UPDATE_SHARE_CARD=1 npx vitest run src/lib/share/shareCard.test.ts writes this file). Lengths are points on the canvas before `scale`. Type names the story tokens (tokens.css \"A story's type\", the apps' Tokens.story*) and faces by their CSS variables (--font-story-serif = Noto Serif TC, --font-story-sans = Noto Sans TC, --font-heading = Playfair Display, --font-body = DM Sans); `type.cjk` or `type.latin` by the story's script (story-script.json); `figures: lining` = lnum. `cardFill` / `cardBorder` are the card's family p = preferredPalette(accentHue, seedFromId(card id)) (Tokens.cardFill{p} / cardBorder{p}); paper and rule are oklch(lightness% chroma CARD_HUES[p]). The outline is wobRect(w, h, radius, seedFromId(card id), min(w, h) × magnitude, options); the rule is wavyLine(width, seed + seedOffset, amplitude, steps). The words are share-passages.json's `opening`. An anonymous card draws `anonymous` in place of the photo, pen name and initials — never them, nor a region or verified mark.",
